;
; Pin table transcribed from datasheets/AD9235BRUZ-20_SUMMARY.md (ADI Rev. D).
; NOTE (low confidence, carried over from the summary, names NOT altered):
;   * D0..D11 LSB->MSB ascending order across pins 15-22 / 25-28 follows the
;     standard ADI convention but was not pin-by-pin quoted from the datasheet
;     figure. Bit order is not ERC-visible; verify before layout.
;   * MODE (pin 2) is a multi-level strap; only its name/function is confirmed.
; Electrical-type choices:
;   VREF  = bidirectional (output in internal-ref mode used here, input in ext-ref mode)
;   REFT/REFB = output (internally generated; decouple only, never drive)
;   SENSE/MODE/PDWN = input (strap pins)
;
device AD9235BRUZ-20
